{"nodes":[{"id":"UCE_01_01","title":"Introduction to Enrollment Certificates and Data Elements","description":"This node introduces the concept of an enrollment certificate, explaining its purpose and common uses, such as providing proof of student status for various applications. Students will learn what constitutes a 'data element' within such a document and why accurately identifying these elements is crucial. The node will provide an initial overview of the types of information typically found, setting the stage for more detailed identification.","status":"locked"},{"id":"UCE_01_02","title":"Identifying Personal and Academic Identifiers","description":"This node focuses on locating and extracting core personal and academic data points from an enrollment certificate. Students will learn to identify the student's name, unique student ID number, the name of the educational institution, and specific academic period details like the academic year and semester of enrollment. Understanding these identifiers is fundamental to verifying the student's identity and current academic status.","status":"locked"},{"id":"UCE_01_03","title":"Identifying Document Metadata and Administrative Details","description":"This node delves into identifying administrative information and metadata related to the enrollment certificate itself. Students will learn to pinpoint the document's official title (e.g., 'Certificate of Enrollment'), the date it was issued, and any details pertaining to the issuing authority or operator. Recognizing these elements helps in validating the document's authenticity and currency, distinguishing between the student's information and the document's administrative context.","status":"locked"},{"id":"UCE_01_04","title":"Categorizing Data Elements and Understanding Their Significance","description":"In this node, students will learn to systematically categorize all identified data elements into logical groups, such as personal information, academic details, and administrative metadata. Beyond identification, the node emphasizes understanding the significance of each data point. Students will explore why specific elements like student IDs ensure unique identification, how enrollment dates confirm active status, and why the issue date is vital for document validity, reinforcing the importance of accurate data handling.","status":"locked"}]}
