tment and Economic Models","unit_goal":"To analyze the substantial capital expenditure requirements, financial structures, and economic considerations that underpin the high-cost, high-return nature of advanced foundry operations."},{"unit_title":"Charting the Future: Emerging Technologies and Industry Evolution","unit_goal":"To investigate the frontiers of semiconductor technology, including sub-nanometer advancements and future trends, and their potential impact on the industry's trajectory."}]}
