Group related mistakes together when that improves pedagogy.

### SUPPORTED COMPONENTS ONLY
You may ONLY use one of these components:
- `Ordering`
- `MatchingPairs`
- `FeynmanMirror`
- `MultipleChoice`

Do NOT use any other component names.
